tab mem | Memory | memory_alt

sub kernel | Kernel memory

tweak mem.kernel | lock | rec ram12 reboot
  name  Keep kernel in RAM
  desc  Stops Windows from paging kernel code and drivers to disk and turns off page combining. Only worth it with 12 GB of RAM or more.
  R     CC\Session Manager\Memory Management | DisablePagingExecutive | d:1 | -
  R     CC\Session Manager\Memory Management | DisablePageCombining | d:1 | -

tweak mem.svchost | account_tree | reboot
  name  Group service hosts
  desc  Runs Windows services in a few shared svchost processes instead of one process each, which saves memory and process overhead.
  R     SYS\Control | SvcHostSplitThresholdInKB | d:4294967295 | d:3670016
  SPLIT BFE DcomLaunch mpssvc PlugPlay Power SamSs EventSystem CryptSvc Dhcp Dnscache DisplayEnhancementService PcaSvc WdiSystemHost AudioEndpointBuilder Appinfo BITS gpsvc IKEEXT iphlpsvc lmhosts
  SPLIT NcbService RasAuto RasMan SENS ShellHWDetection SstpSvc TrkWks Winmgmt EventLog FontCache NlaSvc nsi ProfSvc Schedule SessionEnv Themes W32Time Wcmsvc LanmanServer LanmanWorkstation

tweak mem.fth | healing | rec
  name  Fault Tolerant Heap off
  desc  Stops Windows from silently applying slower crash-proof heap shims to apps that crashed before.
  R     M\FTH | Enabled | d:0 | d:1
  C     rundll32.exe fthsvc.dll,FthSysprepSpecialize

sub cache | Prefetch & caching

tweak mem.prefetch | cached | rec reboot
  name  Prefetch & SysMain off
  desc  Turns off the boot and app prefetcher, Superfetch and its tracing. Pointless on SSDs and frees memory and disk activity.
  R     CC\Session Manager\Memory Management\PrefetchParameters | EnablePrefetcher | d:0 | d:3
  R     CC\Session Manager\Memory Management\PrefetchParameters | EnableSuperfetch | d:0 | d:3
  R     CC\Session Manager\Memory Management\PrefetchParameters | SfTracingState | d:0 | -
  R     SV\Superfetch\Parameters | EnableSuperfetch | d:0 | -
  R     CC\Session Manager\Memory Management\PrefetchParameters | EnableBootTrace | d:0 | -

tweak mem.compress | compress | rec ram12
  name  Memory compression off
  desc  Stops Windows from compressing memory pages in RAM. With 4 GB or more this saves CPU time; on low-RAM PCs compression helps, so it is skipped there.
  MMAGENT mc off

tweak mem.readyboost | sd_card | rec
  name  ReadyBoost caches off
  desc  Stops Windows from creating ReadyBoost caches on USB sticks and SD cards. Useless with an SSD.
  R     NT\EMDMgmt | AllowNewCachesByDefault | d:0 | -
  R     NT\EMDMgmt | GroupPolicyDisallowCaches | d:1 | -

tweak mem.inputpre | keyboard | rec
  name  Input app preloading off
  desc  Stops Windows from keeping the touch keyboard and handwriting panel loaded in memory in case you need them.
  R     M\Input | IsInputAppPreloadEnabled | d:0 | -
